  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-engineering-services",
      "text": "IDE engineering services for **DeepSeek Harness (dsh)** — a host plugin porting the\n`pi-engineering-services` suite: **LSP / DAP / Task** three pillars + an IDE-tooling usage skill."
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-engineering-services",
      "text": "| Pillar | What it provides | Entry |\n|---|---|---|\n| LSP | 12 tools: diagnostics, navigation, rename, workspace symbol | `src/lsp/dsh-lsp.ts` |\n| DAP | `debug` tool, ~28 actions (debugpy + js-debug) | `src/dap/dap.ts` |\n| Task | build/test/lint discovery & run (npm / make / just) | `src/task/task.ts` |\n| Skill | usage policy & how-to for the three tool sets | `skills/ide-three-pillars/SKILL.md` |\n| Runbook | install / activate / smoke / troubleshoot | `skills/ide-runbook/SKILL.md` |"
    },
    {
      "section": "Verified scope (kept from the pi edition)",
      "text": "- **LSP**: pyright (Python) + typescript-language-server (TS/JS). Others are configurable but experimental.\n- **DAP**: **debugpy** (Python) + **js-debug** (JS/TS, vendored). Others are configured but experimental.\n- **Task**: npm scripts / Makefile / justfile.\n\nLanguage servers and debug adapters beyond this are present in the config but **not tested**."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "from a local checkout (dev iteration)",
      "text": "cd dsh-engineering-services-dsh\nnpm i -D typescript      # dev typecheck/build tooling (typescript)\nnpm run build            # scripts/build.mjs → tsc emits lib/ + copies vendored dap assets\ndsh plugin --profile web add link:$PWD"
    },
    {
      "section": "debug launch program=... (needs debugpy / js-debug runtimes, see below)",
      "text": "```\n\n> Build tooling note: this package uses a **plain Node ESM build** (`scripts/build.mjs` →\n> `tsc` + copy vendored `dap/js-debug`/`dap/debugpy` into `lib/`). There is **no tsdown/bundler**.\n> For tsserver to work, the workspace must resolve a `typescript@5` with `lib/tsserver.js`;\n> see the runbook skill (section *tsserver 的标准修法*)."
    },
    {
      "section": "debug launch program=... (needs debugpy / js-debug runtimes, see below)",
      "text": "The plugin's node half registers the tools through the `tools` registry and the IDE-tooling\nguidance section through the system-prompt registry (both probed at runtime, mirroring dsh-genui)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Configuration (`pi-lsp.json`)",
      "text": "Language servers are configured with the **same schema as the pi edition**:\n\n- Project-local: `<workspace>/.dsh/pi-lsp.json`\n- User/global: `~/.dsh/pi-lsp.json`\n\n```json\n{\n  \"timeout\": 20000,\n  \"servers\": {\n    \"pyright\": { \"command\": [\"pyright-langserver\", \"--stdio\"], \"extensions\": [\".py\", \".pyi\"] },"
    },
    {
      "section": "Configuration (`pi-lsp.json`)",
